  - Damm check digit
  - open data
abstract: >-
  Every compound in Gabon has an N-Ways code: the name of a quarter or village people already
  say and a number of three to five digits, unique in the country on its own. This repository
  holds the specification, the reference engine, the complete registry of 665,089 codes, a
  ready-made server and API, the tools that built the data, and the research paper in English
  and French. Data under ODbL 1.0, documents under CC BY 4.0, code under Apache 2.0.
